#*:: When the brook made a looking glass of its water, / In whose surface a thousand stars were a-glitter, / Johnny '''was standing''' at the foot of Nell's yard; / Though to tell how he'd come to it would have been hard. {{q|''literally: “… Johnny was…”''}}

